  positional_uncertainity float8 [note: 'CgPoint positionalUncertainity; the XSD gives no description.; source: XSD CgPoint/@positionalUncertainity; type xs:double']
  Note: 'CgPoint: Represents a COrdinate GeOmetry Point. The Point is identified by the "name" attr and the data value will be a sequence of space delimented, two or three double numberic values: (Northing Easting) or (Northing Easting Elevation).'
