  sta_end float8 [note: 'Represents the actual measured distance along the geometry in numeric decimal form expressed in linear units. Also known as the internal station value where no station equations are applied. Distance along the geometry in the file\'s declared linear unit; kept unconverted. Not corrected for station equations.; source: XSD ClimbLane/@staEnd; type station']
