  pi_pnt_ref uuid [note: 'A reference name value referring to a PointType derived name attribute. An attribute if this type contains the value of a PointType derived element "name" attribute that exists elsewhere the instance data. Holds the `name` attribute of the referenced element (a name-based reference, resolved when the file is imported).; ref to landxml.cg_point; source: XSD PI/@pntRef; type pointNameRef']
