  end_longitude float8 [note: 'Latitude/Longitude coordinate angular values expressed in latLongAngularUnit. Latitude (range -90 to +90) positive values for the northern hemispher, negative indicate the southern. Stored in radians. The file value is expressed in Units latLongAngularUnit (default decimal degrees) and is converted at the import boundary.; source: XSD End/@longitude; type latLongAngle']
